        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to regulations in the United States, we are subject to a variety of regulations in other jurisdictions governing, among other things, research and development, clinical trials, testing, manufacturing, safety, efficacy, quality control, labeling, packaging, storage, record keeping, distribution, reporting, export and import, advertising, marketing and other promotional practices involving biological products as well as authorization, approval as well as post-approval monitoring and reporting of our products.",
        "start_character": 111604,
        "end_character": 112128
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, pursuant to the Paragon Option Agreement, we have the option to develop two additional anti-mutCALR product candidates: DMR-002, an undisclosed mechanism of action, and DMR-003, a bispecific CD3 x anti-mutCALR T cell engager.",
        "start_character": 27885,
        "end_character": 28123
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our previously announced Asset Acquisition (as defined below), we bolstered our pipeline with the addition of three product candidates designed to treat myeloproliferative neoplasms (“MPNs”), a group of related, chronic disorders of the bone marrow.",
        "start_character": 127,
        "end_character": 379
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "On February 10, 2026, we entered into a sales agreement (the “ATM Agreement”), pursuant to which we may sell, from time-to-time, shares of our common stock under an at-the-market (“ATM”) offering program for up to $150.0 million.",
        "start_character": 37208,
        "end_character": 37437
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Should any of our product candidates be approved for commercialization, we intend to develop a plan to commercialize them in the United States and other key markets, through internal infrastructure and/or external partnerships in a manner that will",
        "start_character": 57984,
        "end_character": 58232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the Paragon Option Agreement, on a Research Program-by-Research Program and product-by-product basis, we are required to make one-time non-refundable milestone payments to Paragon of up to a total of $22.0 million, upon the achievement of certain clinical development and regulatory milestones.",
        "start_character": 49378,
        "end_character": 49678
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the terms of a License Agreement, we expect that we will have sole authority over and control of the development, regulatory approval, manufacturing and commercialization of such in-licensed product worldwide.",
        "start_character": 45507,
        "end_character": 45722
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have the option to license exclusive worldwide development and commercialization rights from Paragon of two other mutCALR-targeting product candidates, DMR-002 and DMR-003, pursuant to the Paragon Option Agreement.",
        "start_character": 1894,
        "end_character": 2116
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are aware of several companies with product candidates in development for the treatment of patients with mutCALR-driven MPNs, including Incyte’s INCA033989 and INCA035784, Janssen Pharmaceuticals, Inc.’s JNJ-88549968, Meiji Seika Pharma’s mutCALR TCE, Prelude Therapeutics, LLC’s mCALR CDK9d DAC, Alethio Therapeutics’ AT-02, PharmaEssentia Corporation’s ropeginterferon alfa-2b, Merck & Co., Inc’s bomedemstat, Novartis AG’s pelabresib, Geron Corporation’s imetelstat, and Kartos Therapeutics, Inc.’s navtemadlin.",
        "start_character": 59639,
        "end_character": 60156
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We periodically evaluate our product pipeline to assess whether development of certain assets in our portfolio align with our strategic objectives.",
        "start_character": 6889,
        "end_character": 7036
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "DMR-001 is designed to improve on the clinical activity and pharmacokinetics of INCA033989, which we believe will provide the opportunity to capture a sizable portion of the mutCALR market.",
        "start_character": 11113,
        "end_character": 11302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-115922",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-115922-b69d6fd60f7d53aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-115922",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Following the Asset Acquisition, we will need to invest in infrastructure and the continuing research and development being conducted under the Paragon Option Agreement to be able to have any measurable outputs.",
